# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# `npm run build:link-e2e` output. Deliberately NOT dist/: that bundle advertises
# link/1 and must never be the thing a deploy picks up by accident.
dist-link-e2e
# Browser evidence from `e2e/mixed-link.mjs --screenshots`.
e2e-screenshots
# Machine-readable inventory from `e2e/a11y-scan.mjs --json`. The pass/fail
# verdict is the allowlist, not a checked-in snapshot of findings. Glob so the
# per-run names (a11y-report-fixed.json, …) are covered too.
a11y-report*.json

